All 45 Paris tests should pass (30 already pass, 15 currently failing).

Key test validations:
- `test_extracts_product_from_jsonld` → name from merged JSON-LD ✓
- `test_extracts_price` → price from JSON-LD offers ✓
- `test_extracts_sku_from_rsc` → sku from merged RSC data ✓
- `test_extracts_image_from_rsc` → image from merged RSC data ✓
- `test_product_key_used_as_id` → product_id from merged RSC data ✓
- `test_price_change_creates_new_history` → external_id found, offer updated ✓
- `test_full_pipeline_creates_product_store_offer_price_history` → full data merged ✓

